// fallback for any block without its own definition
// <name> <shape> <textures...>  * = base block name (grass_block), ^ = state tag ([snowy=true], empty if stateless)
// a single texture is used on every face
// name[prop=a|b] matches every state with those property values; the most specific match wins
// options go after the textures: rotate=random turns the top and bottom textures randomly per block
// (from its position within the chunk), rotate=random_all turns every face, rotate=mirror randomly
// mirrors every face and turns top/bottom 0 or 180 degrees (like vanilla stone)
// uv=<t>,<t>,... sets a transform per face (same order as the textures), with / between variants picked
// at random per block; a transform is r0/r90/r180/r270, prefixed with m to mirror first (e.g. deepslate)
@default full *
